                                                "sense_id": "c4195277-79fc-3bb9-a387-22f8d4836a15",
                                                "text": "The collision was in part my fault: I was starting to fall asleep at the wheel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1c54114-32ae-4d77-9732-a7935fc1eb25",
                                                "sense_id": "c4195277-79fc-3bb9-a387-22f8d4836a15",
                                                "text": "Cervicitis was initially described >30 years ago as “the ignored counterpart of urethritis in men”, most likely because the 2 syndromes share known etiologies. However, cervicitis differs from male urethritis in that low-grade signs of infection more often go unnoticed, in part due to the need for a speculum exam to observe these."
                                            }
                                        ]
